#: ../../../build/NEWS:714
msgid ""
":gh:`102988`: :func:`email.utils.getaddresses` "
"and :func:`email.utils.parseaddr` now return ``('', '')`` 2-tuples in more "
"situations where invalid email addresses are encountered instead of "
"potentially inaccurate values. Add optional *strict* parameter to these two "
"functions: use ``strict=False`` to get the old behavior, accept malformed "
"inputs. ``getattr(email.utils, 'supports_strict_parsing', False)`` can be "
"use to check if the *strict* paramater is available. Patch by Thomas Dwyer "
"and Victor Stinner to improve the :cve:`2023-27043` fix."
