#: ../../../build/NEWS:5707
msgid ""
":issue:`47212`: Raise :exc:`IndentationError` instead of :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"for a bare ``except`` with no following indent. Improve :exc:`SyntaxError` "
"locations for an un-parenthesized generator used as arguments. Patch by "
"Matthieu Dartiailh."
msgstr ""
