"ドと、その内容へのアクセスに使うマクロについて、不正確な表現を修正しました。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:6145
msgid ""
":issue:`42340`: Document that in some circumstances :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` "
"may cause the code to enter an inconsistent state. Provided a sample "
"workaround to avoid it if needed."
msgstr ""
