#: ../../../build/NEWS:6254
msgid ""
":issue:`40421`: Add ``PyFrame_GetBuiltins``, ``PyFrame_GetGenerator`` and "
"``PyFrame_GetGlobals`` C-API functions to access frame object attributes "
"safely from C code."
msgstr ""
