#: ../../../build/NEWS:7361
msgid ""
":issue:`22047`: Calling :meth:`add_argument_group` on an argument group is "
"deprecated. Calling :meth:`add_argument_group` "
"or :meth:`add_mutually_exclusive_group` on a mutually exclusive group is "
