"た。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:7855
msgid ""
":issue:`45695`: Out-of-tree builds with a read-only source directory are now "
"tested by CI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45695`: 読み取り専用のソースディレクトリを使うソースツリー外のビルド"
