#: ../../../build/NEWS:8347
msgid ":issue:`45449`: Add note about :pep:`585` in :mod:`collections.abc`."
msgstr ""
":issue:`45449`: :mod:`collections.abc` に :pep:`585` についての注記を追加しま"
"した。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8349
msgid ""
":issue:`45516`: Add protocol description to "
"the :class:`importlib.abc.Traversable` documentation."
