"に追加しました。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:8358
msgid ""
":issue:`45678`: Add tests for scenarios in "
"which :class:`functools.singledispatchmethod` is stacked on top of a method "
"that has already been wrapped by two other decorators. Patch by Alex Waygood."
msgstr ""
