#: ../../../build/NEWS:9818
msgid ""
":issue:`43086`: Added a new optional :code:`strict_mode` parameter to "
"*binascii.a2b_base64*. When :code:`scrict_mode` is set to :code:`True`, the "
"*a2b_base64* function will accept only valid base64 content. More details "
