#: ../../../build/NEWS:15363
msgid ""
":issue:`38576`: Disallow control characters in hostnames in http.client, "
"addressing :cve:`2019-18348`. Such potentially malicious header injection "
"URLs now cause a InvalidURL to be raised."
msgstr ""
