#: ../../../build/NEWS:18789
msgid ""
":issue:`38644`: Provide :c:func:`Py_EnterRecursiveCall` "
"and :c:func:`Py_LeaveRecursiveCall` as regular functions for the limited "
"API. Previously, there were defined as macros, but these macros didn't work "
"with the limited API which cannot access ``PyThreadState.recursion_depth`` "
"field. Remove ``_Py_CheckRecursionLimit`` from the stable ABI."
msgstr ""
":issue:`38644`: 制限付き API で :c:func:`Py_EnterRecursiveCall` "
"と :c:func:`Py_LeaveRecursiveCall` を通常の関数として提供するようにしまし"
"た。\n"
"以前はマクロでしたが、制限付き API では ``PyThreadState.recursion_depth`` "
"フィールドにアクセスできず、これらのマクロは動作しませんでした。\n"
"安定 ABI から ``_Py_CheckRecursionLimit`` を削除しました。"

#: ../../../build/NEWS:18795
msgid ""
":issue:`38650`: The global variable :c:data:`PyStructSequence_UnnamedField` "
