#: ../../../build/NEWS:23586 ../../../build/NEWS:24239
#: ../../../build/NEWS:28611
msgid ""
":issue:`21474`: Update word/identifier definition from ascii to unicode. In "
"text and entry boxes, this affects selection by double-click, movement left/"
"right by control-left/right, and deletion left/right by control-BACKSPACE/"
